<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian forces are again reported to be moving troops and advisers toward Saudi Arabia and Yemen while Damascus denies any deployment, and a diplomatic source says military agreements with Saudi Arabia are limited to training and expertise exchange. Iranian discontent is heightening cross-border threats to Syria, according to experts. A Syrian soldier was killed and another wounded by a landmine explosion in Deir ez-Zor. Flood waters collapsed a bridge in eastern Syria, killing one person. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQNEp6NVBtbHhsbUIxVVRFM25lbmxYLWN0MmlhV1BTYTRZMHhJM0ppSmJhaHJfM05rNWI2UnRQVGEzT0lubW5XemFpd3Jnc1NFeUVrVFNMWUJ6Xzd4dEp1U2ZZLXMzV0VpTDNoWF9FeGFIb1l5TTRmbHhhOGhXblhRcVpVOWJTdktfYVN5b2JURXJ6LWR3U1JzY2tvSmxWbHdQUUVXVWRZUWNlQk1wdTZ2em1heHpLWXBEZTVnRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/6/turkiyes-parliament-ratifies-mecca-defence-agreement&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQU296X3hkOU4xaVk0LVBZZjFjbVZtdXk0djFQb3l4OGtNNS1CYWhZUi1UTUxUMU1kZ01najF2RGp1VVAyS1lVTWxHUmR5TGM5N2RyUndaQ0ZZQmswTk02ZFc4dmtGWENkTVUtdE1wNnJESUVKdGgxbkwwaTFIT3BKZ0dFTGh2VWtfZ3BGZUx1Zl9UUm5VcWNhb0VJUVVxQ0FMR3J1RXB1NDRINWhkTUNjamZxU3g4OFlzT1YxQXVXWnlaQm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOd3hUbFZFalZyNW5HUGFVM1hUU3BkbUFES2x0OFhDWUF3ZDdKQkpGNmZUWjhZQmEzelJGYlhqaHJlc3VwaEtUZ2JKdENPLTg3aTJwOElURFZ1cXQ2YkFRMWQyLUd4LWNOLUN2X29uWkFlemdIakxOc0tjWFp2V3ZrWHFMdkMyRWU0dnZwWHlKYThrcGV0VnJhQUtiYWh1ZGo4cXA3RXhCYnVnUGdKb2dBeHg0eHRpbUJORHg5aDdhVk8?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Media Line&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl